// The ball's known calibrated address/tee position, in the same (camera-
// local) coordinate frame Triangulator reports — for this rig that's
// (0, 0, StereoCalibrationData.DefaultMeasurementDistanceM) since the tee
// sits dead center on the stereo pair's shared boresight (confirmed
